# NAGROUP Spice — Session Walkthrough

## What Was Done

### 1. 🖋️ Fonts & Color Palette
- **Fonts**: Switched to `Playfair Display` (headings) + `Raleway` (body) for a premium editorial feel
- **Global reset** added to enforce font consistency across all pages/routes
- **Color palette** (CSS variables): amber `#92400e`, warm cream `#faf7f2`, golden tan for dark sections
- New `--clr-dark-text`, `--clr-dark-muted`, `--clr-dark-faint` variables for readable text on dark/brown backgrounds

### 2. 🔗 Navbar Routing — All Fixed
| Nav Link | Route |
|---|---|
| Home | `/` |
| Export Products | `/products` |
| News | `/articles` |
| Contact Us | `/contact` |

- **Header** redesigned: top contact bar (phone + email), animated hover underlines, "Get a Quote" CTA button
- **Category tiles** on homepage now link correctly: `/category/cinnamon`, `/category/ginger`, `/category/pepper`, `/category/star-anise`, `/category/turmeric`

### 3. 📂 Category Pages (`/category/:slug`)
Each spice category now has a dedicated page with:
- Dark hero banner + breadcrumb
- Sidebar with all categories + product counts
- Filtered product grid

### 4. 📄 Product Detail Pages — All 12 Products
Every product (`/products/:slug`) now shows:
- Product image + name, category, FOB price
- **Description** tab (English only — removed Vietnamese "Mô tả")
- Full **Quick Details** table (15–25 spec rows)
- **Container Storage / Shelf Life** panel
- **Packaging, Shipping & Delivery Time** panel
- **For More Information** checklist with ✓ bullets
- **Related Products** with **Read More** buttons (replaced "Đọc tiếp")

Products enriched: Cigarettes Cassia, Cassia Powder, Cassia Broken, Whole Cassia, Ground Pepper, White Pepper, Black Pepper, Turmeric Powder, Organic Cayenne Powder, Madras Curry Powder, Cinnamon Powder, Granulated Garlic

### 5. 🚢 Global Shipping Section
- **"Discuss Container Loads"** button now links directly to `/contact`

### 6. 🦶 Footer Redesign
Inspired by XStore Spice House reference:
- **Top CTA strip** — "Ready to Source Premium Vietnamese Spices?" + amber "Get a Quote" button
- **Brand column** — NAGROUP SPICE logo, tagline, address, phone, email, social icons (Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, Twitter)
- **3 link columns** — Our Story / Categories / Support
- **Bottom bar** — copyright, Privacy Policy, Terms, Contact

### 7. 🏷️ Branding
- **Browser tab**: `NAGROUP Spice - Excite your palate`
- **Logo**: `NAGROUP SPICE` / *Excite your palate*

### 8. 🆕 New Pages Created
| Page | Path |
|---|---|
| Products List | `/products` |
| Category Page | `/category/:slug` |
| Articles | `/articles` |
| Contact + Enquiry Form | `/contact` |

### 9. 📦 Git
All changes committed and pushed to `origin/main` (GitHub), ready for Cloudflare Pages deployment.

